docs {
  # Create SeaweedFS Volumes

  Create new volumes in SeaweedFS cluster.

  ## Request Body
  - `count`: Number of volumes to create
  - `dataCenter`: Target data center (optional)
  - `rack`: Target rack (optional)
  - `replication`: Replication strategy (optional)
}
